WEBVTT

afferent-light
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Kuwala kukalowa m'diso kumayambitsa uthenga m'njira ya minyewa yochokera m'diso kupita ku ubongo.

afferent-brain
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:23.000
Tsatirani njira zamitunduzi kuchokera pa retina, kudzera mu mtsempha wa kuona, pamene mitsempha imadutsana, mpaka ku malo ake mu ubongo.

efferent-definition
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Uthenga wochokera muubongo umapita ku diso m'njira ziwiri. Parasympathetic imachepetsa mwana wa diso ndipo sympathetic imakulitsa.

parasympathetic
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Mtsempha wachitatu wa muubongo umanyamulanso uthenga umene umachepetsa mwana wa diso.

constrictor
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Imatumiza uthenga ku mnofu wa iris umene umachepetsa mwana wa diso, ndi ku mnofu umene umasintha mmene galasi la diso limalunjikira kuwala.

third-nerve
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Mtsempha wachitatu umayendetsa kayendedwe kambiri ka diso ndi kukweza chikope. Mtsempha wa nkhope umathandiza kutseka ndi kutsegula zikope.

sympathetic
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Njira ya sympathetic imadutsa mndandanda wa magulu a minyewa ndi gulu lapamwamba la minyewa la m'khosi.

dilator
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Imalumikiza minofu iwiri. Woyamba umakulitsa mwana wa diso. Wa Müller umathandiza kukweza chikope.

reflex-input
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Kuwala kukalowa m'diso limodzi, uthenga umapita ku ubongo kudzera m'njira yochokera m'disolo.

reflex-output
00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Mauthenga ochokera pakati pa ubongo amafika m'maso onse awiri. Choncho ana a maso onse amachepa chifukwa cha kuwala.

reflex-direct
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.500
Mwana wa diso lowunikidwa amayankha mwachindunji.

reflex-consensual
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.000
Mwana wa diso lina nayenso amayankha ngakhale kuti sanaunikiridwe.

observe
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:53.000
Yang'anani kukula ndi kaonekedwe ka ana a maso onse awiri, ndipo muone ngati akufanana.

compare-observation
00:01:53.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Yang'anani kusintha kwa mtundu kapena kaonekedwe, kusiyana kwa kukula kwa ana a maso, ndi zikope zotsikira pansi.

light
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:14.000
Yatsani Arclight ndi kusankha kuwala kwamphamvu kwambiri. Gwiritsani ntchito chipinda chabata chokhala ndi kuwala kochepa.

distance
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Pemphani wodwala kuti ayang'ane chinthu chakutali.

clear-view
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Onetsetsani kuti sakuyang'ana woyezayo

move-light
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Sunthani kuwala kuchokera pambali kulunjika pa mwana wa diso.

watch
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Yang'anani mmene mwana wa diso amene waunikiridwa akuyankhira kuwalako.

shine-constrict
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Unikirani m'diso ndipo onani mwana wa diso akuchepa.

compare-responses
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:56.000
Onani ngati mwana wa diso akuchepa pang'ono kapena sakuchepa n'komwe.

corresponding-examples
00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:04.000
Zimenezi zikhoza kugwirizana ndi matenda osiyanasiyana. Kuyankha kwa mwana wa diso kokha sikungasonyeze matenda amene ayambitsa vutolo.

pupil-colour
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Mwana wa diso kuoneka waimvi kapena woyera sikutanthauza kuti sangathe kuchepa.

cataract-constriction
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:28.000
Ng'ala ingapangitse mwana wa diso kuoneka waimvi kapena woyera. Koma mwana wa disoyo ayenera kuchepabe ngati njira yoyendetsera kuyankha kuwala ikugwira ntchito.

consensual-first
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:36.000
Unikirani diso limodzi ndipo onani mwana wa diso linalo akuchepa. Izi ndi kuyankha kwa diso losaunikiridwa.

consensual-other
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:50.000
Bwerezani mbali inayo ndipo yang'anani mwana wa diso limene silinaunikiridwe.

swing-method
00:03:50.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Sunthani kuwala pakati pa maso awiriwo. Imani masekondi awiri mpaka atatu pa diso lililonse. Yerekezani ana a maso onse awiri.

swing-return
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:10.000
Bwezerani kuwala ku diso lina ndipo yang'anani ana a maso onse pamene mukusintha mbali.

swing-normal
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Nthawi zambiri ana a maso onse amachepa mofanana mukaunikira diso lililonse.

swing-rapd
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:34.000
Vuto lotchedwa RAPD limatanthauza kuti diso limodzi limatumiza uthenga wofooka wa kuwala kusiyana ndi lina. Apa ana a maso onse amakula kuwala kukasamukira ku diso lakumanja limene lili ndi vuto.

near-distance
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:39.375
Choyamba pemphani wodwalayo kuti ayang'ane chinthu chakutali.

near-target
00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:55.000
Kenako pemphani wodwalayo kuti ayang'ane chinthu chapafupi pa Arclight.

near-normal
00:04:55.000 --> 00:05:05.000
Maso amatembenukira mkati kuti ayang'ane chinthu chapafupi. Nthawi yomweyo ana a maso amachepa ndipo magalasi a m'maso amasintha kuti chinthucho chioneke bwino.

near-abnormal
00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:15.000
Ngati maso satembenukira mkati pamodzi poyang'ana chinthu chapafupi, wodwalayo afunika kuyezedwanso.
